      "id": "s0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "smbinfo",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Userspace helper to display SMB-specific file information for the Linux SMB client file system (CIFS)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0003",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "Manual section:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "1",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "SYNOPSIS",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "smbinfo [[[p0]]] [[[p1]]] [[[p2]]] {command} {file system object}",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-v"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "-h"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "-V"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "DESCRIPTION",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This tool is part of the cifs-utils suite.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "smbinfo is a userspace helper program for the Linux SMB client file system (CIFS). It is intended to display SMB-specific file informations such as Security Descriptors and Quota.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This tool works by making an CIFS_QUERY_INFO IOCTL call to the Linux SMB client which in turn issues a SMB Query Info request and returns the result. This differs from getcifsacl which uses extended file attributes.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "OPTIONS",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0012",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-v"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Print version number and exit.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0014",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-V"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Verbose output.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0016",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-h"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Print help explaining the command line options.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "COMMAND",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "fileaccessinfo: Prints the FileAccessInformation class",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "filealigninfo: Prints the FileAlignmentInformation class",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "fileallinfo: Prints the FileAllInformation class",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "filealternatenameinfo: Prints the FileAlternateNameInformation class",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "filebasicinfo: Prints the FileBasicInformation class",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "fileeainfo: Prints the FileEaInformation class",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "filefsfullsizeinfo: Prints the FileFsFullSizeInformation class",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "fileinternalinfo: Prints the FileInternalInformation class",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "filemodeinfo: Prints the FileModeInformation class",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "filenormalizednameinfo: Prints the FileNormalizedNameInformation class",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "filepositioninfo: Prints the FilePositionInformation class",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "filestandardinfo: Prints the FileStandardInformation class",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "filestreaminfo: Prints the FileStreamInformation class",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "filecompressioninfo: Prints the FileCompressionInformation class",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "fsctl-getobjid: Prints the ObjectID",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "getcompression: Prints the compression setting for the file.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "setcompression [[p0]] <no|default|lznt1>: Sets the compression setting for the file.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-c"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "list-snapshots: Lists the previous versions of the volume that backs this file",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "quota: Print the quota for the volume in the form - SID Length - Change Time - Quota Used - Quota Threshold - Quota Limit - SID",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "secdesc: Print the security descriptor in the form - Revision - Control - Owner SID - Group SID - ACL - File types - File flags",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "keys: Dump session id, encryption keys and decryption keys so that the SMB3 traffic of this mount can be decryped e.g. via wireshark (requires root).",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "gettconinfo: Prints both the TCON Id and Session Id for a cifs file.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "notify: Query a directory for change notifications.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "NOTES",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Kernel support for smbinfo utilities requires the CIFS_QUERY_INFO IOCTL which was initially introduced in the 4.20 kernel and is only implemented for mount points using SMB2 or above (see mount.cifs(8) vers option).",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "SEE ALSO",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "mount.cifs(8), getcifsacl(1)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
